
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BANK-LOAN.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 BANK-RECORD.
   05 CUSTOMER-NAME   PIC X(20) VALUE "SIVA".
   05 ACCOUNT-NUMBER  PIC 9(6) VALUE 123456.
   05 ACCOUNT-STATUS  PIC X VALUE "A".
      88 ACTIVE-ACCOUNT VALUE "A".
      88 BLOCKED-ACCOUNT VALUE "B".
   05 LOAN-AMOUNT     PIC 9(7) VALUE 100000.
   05 INTEREST-RATE   PIC 99 VALUE 8.

77 LOAN-INTEREST PIC 9(7) VALUE 0.
77 LOAN-YEARS    PIC 9 VALUE 2.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    DISPLAY "CUSTOMER: " CUSTOMER-NAME.
    DISPLAY "ACCOUNT: " ACCOUNT-NUMBER.

    IF ACTIVE-ACCOUNT
        DISPLAY "ACCOUNT IS ACTIVE"

        COMPUTE LOAN-INTEREST =
            LOAN-AMOUNT * INTEREST-RATE * LOAN-YEARS / 100

        DISPLAY "LOAN INTEREST: " LOAN-INTEREST
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "ACCOUNT IS BLOCKED"
    END-IF.

    STOP RUN.
